          "title": "Jobs - Dagster Docs",
          "snippet": "When a job begins, it kicks off a run. A run is a single execution of a job in Dagster . Runs can be launched and viewed in the Dagster UI. Benefits Using jobs provides the following benefits: Automation: With schedules and sensors , jobs can be used to automate the execution of your Dagster pipelines . Refer to the Automation guide for more info.",
